# Instructions to obtain a Google Cloud YouTube Data API v3 key:
# 1. Navigate to: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Create a new Google Cloud Project or select an existing project.
# 3. Under "APIs & Services", enable "YouTube Data API v3".
# 4. Generate an API Key under Credentials.
# 5. Copy your API key and set it below.
#
# Replace the placeholder below with your personal API key:
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=your_youtube_api_key_here
